IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `apa-documents`

-- Apostille Act 2020, ss 2, 6, 9-12, 14-17 and the Second Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_apostille-act-2020.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

