§ `ss 16, 17`

#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer asking the Academy for a birth certificate` EQUALS `must issue`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `the signer asking the Academy for a court order` EQUALS `must issue`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a stranger asking the Academy` EQUALS `no duty under section 16 -- requester neither signed nor bears it`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer who has not paid the fee` EQUALS `must refuse`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer of a suspected forgery` EQUALS `must refuse`
