#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer of a private letter` EQUALS `must refuse`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer whose signature cannot be verified` EQUALS `may refuse`
#ASSERT `what the authority must do` `a bearer withholding required information` EQUALS `must refuse`

